Z||000003||Neal||07-11-2001||04:16 PM||||Ok, the big GM cam and crane 2030 are regarded as the biggest you can use in the 2.8, how much bigger can you go a still be computer friendly in the 3.1/3.4?<P>I rebuilt my 2.8 with a 2030 in it and was pretty happy, but i cracked a head and it resulted in a spun bearing.  so i have the 2030 barley used and was wondering if it will be enough cam for a 3.4?||||reg||1
